Balaban --> Facade : exact non-promotion theorem
Pareto --> Facade : recognition Pareto boundary
Snowball --> Facade : execution frontier
Phase --> Facade : phase-resolution frontier
HZeta --> Facade : explicit H-zeta max-cut
Historical --> Facade : historical discriminator
Ternary27 --> MaxCutFacade : C3 action + phase intertwiner
Selected3B --> MaxCutFacade : exact non-promotion cuts
