note bottom of Facade
Preconditions:
- canonical owners exist
- attribution retained
- ESD surfaces read-only

Invariants:
- finite/candidate/search/source facts do not promote truth
- arithmetic does not identify same-object action
- source presence does not create execution receipt
- RG finite control does not create continuum transfer

Postconditions:
- TOE and Unifier expose same exact owners
- direct Balaban scale-transfer non-promotion is reachable
- Ibrahim Pareto/snowball/max-cut boundaries are reachable
- ternary-27 and kernel-BIDI non-promotion cuts are reachable
